WEBVTT

00:19.820 --> 00:24.124
Tozasareta kioku no
naka no kizu ga

00:24.124 --> 00:28.629
Oto mo naku kokoro
ni fureru toki ni

00:28.629 --> 00:36.503
Yasashiku hohoemu sono ura
ni wa kodoku no namida

00:36.503 --> 00:41.308
Hateshinai tsuyosa motomete

00:41.308 --> 00:52.119
Shinjiru monotachi to
nando mo kakeagare

00:52.119 --> 00:54.154
Mamoritai

00:54.154 --> 00:56.490
Shinjitai

00:56.490 --> 01:00.794
Egao no wake wo subete

01:00.794 --> 01:05.199
Hageshisa mo itoshisa mo

01:05.199 --> 01:09.403
Zenbu uketomeru yo

01:09.403 --> 01:13.007
Nidoto sono te wo hanasanai

01:13.007 --> 01:22.348
Ano hikari wo mezashite...

01:31.425 --> 01:34.258
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:38.532 --> 01:42.229
I'll use my powers to transfer
the injuries to myself.

01:55.916 --> 01:57.110
Toshitsugu!

01:57.184 --> 01:59.880
How are Mikado and the empress?

01:59.953 --> 02:04.287
Lord Yoshimasa and the others
are still praying...

02:04.725 --> 02:07.428
But nothing seems
to be working.

02:07.428 --> 02:09.396
There's a lot of commotion
going on in the capital.

02:09.396 --> 02:12.194
I think it's the effect
of the miasma.

02:12.332 --> 02:15.233
If Touda's hands are ever stained
with innocent blood again...

02:15.869 --> 02:18.201
then on that day I will...

02:21.508 --> 02:24.909
All for the Sake of the
Honored Miko

02:32.619 --> 02:36.020
The miasma from the underworld.
How annoying.

02:36.657 --> 02:41.321
What wretched stupidity
to be desecrating my territory.

02:47.701 --> 02:49.203
Forgive us...

02:49.203 --> 02:51.194
Takaokami no Kami.

02:51.805 --> 02:53.898
Guardian Spirit
of the Returning Path...

02:54.808 --> 02:57.743
you may call me Takao
when I'm in this form.

02:57.811 --> 03:00.047
Takao no Kami...

03:00.047 --> 03:03.881
We've broken our back
and endured for such a long time.

03:03.984 --> 03:11.322
But we can't keep the doors of
the underworld closed any longer.

03:11.458 --> 03:15.417
It's been a while since the Miko
of the Returning Path has vanished.

03:16.096 --> 03:20.658
And now, someone is trying
to open the doors again.

03:20.834 --> 03:24.235
Yes, even I feel it...

03:24.304 --> 03:27.102
The dark fetal
activity is intensive.

03:27.207 --> 03:29.937
If only Miko were here...

03:30.177 --> 03:32.008
Do you know where Miko is?

03:32.045 --> 03:35.537
I hate to say this,
but we don't know yet.

03:35.582 --> 03:41.214
When Chishiki no Guuji
tried to open the doors...

03:41.321 --> 03:45.655
he released the miasma and
it's still covering the Capital.

03:45.826 --> 03:52.129
So Chishiki no Guuji has
reappeared after all this time.

04:04.311 --> 04:05.539
Shatter!

04:13.353 --> 04:14.877
Not a chance!

04:25.232 --> 04:26.961
Wave Shield!

04:34.608 --> 04:36.098
Exterminate!

04:38.378 --> 04:39.868
Seimei!

04:45.419 --> 04:47.887
- He stopped my sword!
- Exterminate!

04:48.622 --> 04:54.254
So this is his real power without
the sealing golden crown.

04:56.964 --> 05:00.033
This vessel of mine
is powerful...

05:00.033 --> 05:03.093
It's perfect for killing people.

05:05.105 --> 05:06.572
Restrain!

05:12.846 --> 05:15.474
Is he playing games with us?

05:16.583 --> 05:19.074
This is a pointless struggle.

05:19.119 --> 05:23.249
Just give up and let the fires of
the netherworld consume you.

05:23.357 --> 05:26.554
Kazane, come here now.

05:30.998 --> 05:32.599
Master...

05:32.599 --> 05:35.762
Return to our side.

05:39.206 --> 05:41.299
Don't listen to him!

05:41.408 --> 05:43.968
He's just using you!

05:44.077 --> 05:46.238
Come here, Kazane!

05:49.349 --> 05:50.976
Kazane!

05:51.585 --> 05:55.351
Now... To my mother...

05:55.422 --> 05:58.414
Let's go home together.

06:09.870 --> 06:12.031
Take care of her for me...

06:12.272 --> 06:13.640
Kazane!

06:13.640 --> 06:18.441
It's... it's... too late now.

06:23.150 --> 06:26.608
Well done, Kazane.

06:26.753 --> 06:34.683
That Seimei killed your father and
sent your mother to the underworld.

06:34.795 --> 06:38.094
- That's a lie!
- But why would I lie?

06:38.131 --> 06:41.100
Kazane...
who are you going to believe?

06:41.835 --> 06:43.826
Shut up!

06:44.237 --> 06:50.039
Kazane won't listen to you,
Seimei's servant.

06:50.644 --> 06:52.236
Shut up!

07:10.364 --> 07:13.822
Kai... Kai... Kai!

07:19.039 --> 07:23.032
What's that spiritual power?

07:26.880 --> 07:28.348
What's the matter?

07:28.348 --> 07:31.351
I just sensed Miko's aura.

07:31.351 --> 07:34.843
She is inside the portal.

07:36.890 --> 07:41.520
What?
The Miko is inside the portal?

07:45.031 --> 07:46.498
Kazane!

07:51.538 --> 07:54.507
It's about time we ended this.

07:57.644 --> 07:59.077
Restrain!

08:08.188 --> 08:10.424
Are you still going to fight me?

08:10.424 --> 08:12.119
Interesting...

08:22.602 --> 08:25.469
- Leave now!
- That's...

08:26.506 --> 08:28.642
The Guardian Spirit
of the Returning Path!

08:28.642 --> 08:30.075
Miko!

08:31.578 --> 08:35.309
I've been searching for you,
Miko of the Returning Path!

08:38.018 --> 08:41.283
No... you're not the Miko...

08:41.321 --> 08:45.280
You are... no way.
The princess?

08:45.592 --> 08:47.027
The Miko's daughter?

08:47.027 --> 08:51.020
I see. That's why her spiritual
aura is the same as the Miko's.

08:51.998 --> 08:53.465
Kazane!

08:53.500 --> 08:54.990
Princess...

08:55.168 --> 08:56.897
Our princess...

09:04.878 --> 09:08.336
Annoying Guardian Spirits...
Eat this!

09:14.120 --> 09:17.491
This is ours.

09:17.491 --> 09:23.293
My body... and my life...
belong to the honored Miko!

09:28.502 --> 09:30.337
Guardian Spirits...

09:30.337 --> 09:34.501
You want to sacrifice yourself
to close the black hole!

09:36.877 --> 09:38.310
Kazane!

09:38.912 --> 09:41.710
This spiritual aura...
Takao no Kami?

09:47.187 --> 09:48.984
They escaped.

09:49.289 --> 09:52.588
Someone must have
helped them.

09:54.728 --> 09:57.026
A curse from the Central Skies...

09:57.631 --> 10:02.398
with the power of the honored
souls of the eight skies...

10:02.702 --> 10:05.398
I reflect this curse!

10:05.438 --> 10:08.202
We know we can't halt
the impending disaster,

10:08.241 --> 10:12.109
so we deflect the misfortune
to the source of this curse.

10:19.920 --> 10:22.514
The North Star... it's back!

10:28.895 --> 10:31.489
- Is this Kifune?
- Yes...

10:31.531 --> 10:32.933
But why are we here?

10:32.933 --> 10:34.958
The power of the deity.

10:38.505 --> 10:41.408
Takao no Kami,
thank you very much.

10:41.408 --> 10:43.171
There's no need for thanks.

10:43.209 --> 10:46.042
I just needed to speak with you.

10:48.248 --> 10:50.808
You wish to speak with me?

10:51.151 --> 10:54.654
Taiin, can you summon
the winds to take everyone back?

10:54.654 --> 10:57.316
I have some matters
to discuss with the deity.

10:57.357 --> 10:59.154
I understand.

11:07.467 --> 11:09.298
Abe no Seimei.

11:10.170 --> 11:15.699
Chishiki no Guuji is trying to break
the seals to the underworld again.

11:16.042 --> 11:18.945
- Yes.
- Tell us then...

11:18.945 --> 11:23.177
what exactly happened
in the portal.

11:37.263 --> 11:39.322
Kazane, the daughter of Miko...

11:39.499 --> 11:44.163
and Touda, one of your shikigami
have joined Chishiki no Guuji...

11:44.237 --> 11:45.932
I see.

11:46.006 --> 11:47.940
What dreadful news.

11:48.008 --> 11:53.139
So he's acquired the two keys
to the doors to the underworld.

11:54.247 --> 11:57.614
What do you mean
by two keys?

11:57.784 --> 12:01.720
Aren't the doors protected
by the Miko's power?

12:01.988 --> 12:04.252
That's just hearsay.

12:04.324 --> 12:06.493
The underworld in Izumo
has two doors...

12:06.493 --> 12:08.791
that divide the land of
the dead from the living.

12:08.862 --> 12:13.458
These doors are known
as Chibiki.

12:14.768 --> 12:17.737
The first lies
on the slope of lfuya.

12:17.771 --> 12:21.675
Deep inside a
secret tunnel is a large rock.

12:21.675 --> 12:26.374
Behind this seal is
Miko's resting place.

12:26.613 --> 12:30.549
That was where Ryusai
and you visited before.

12:31.651 --> 12:36.179
The seal is protected by the
Miko and only she can break it.

12:38.491 --> 12:43.952
Since the Miko's missing, her
daughter could be the key.

12:44.064 --> 12:48.091
Right. And there's
another Chibiki rock...

12:48.134 --> 12:51.900
dividing the sacred sanctuary
and the underworld.

12:52.338 --> 12:55.034
That is the second door.

12:55.075 --> 12:59.646
This door is sealed by the god
of the Returning Path...

12:59.646 --> 13:02.809
and cannot be broken
without his power.

13:04.017 --> 13:05.609
So that's why.

13:05.885 --> 13:09.048
Your shikigami, Touda,
already belongs to me.

13:09.155 --> 13:11.024
If I offer this god servant
as a sacrifice...

13:11.024 --> 13:12.592
the seal to the
underworld will be broken.

13:12.592 --> 13:15.823
That way I can break
the seal that binds the dead.

13:15.929 --> 13:19.296
So he's trying
to make Guren the key?

13:19.432 --> 13:21.093
Touda and Kazane...

13:21.201 --> 13:24.830
Now that Chishiki no Guuji
has them in his possession...

13:25.138 --> 13:31.441
both Chibiki rocks will be broken
to release the dead to this world.

13:31.711 --> 13:35.374
We need your help
once again...

13:35.482 --> 13:40.249
to protect the seals and thwart
Chishiki no Guuji's plan.

13:40.420 --> 13:46.484
Seimei, the Guardian Spirits of
the Returning Path need your help.

13:46.659 --> 13:48.490
What say you?

13:51.431 --> 13:54.264
Yes, of course.
And this time...

13:54.567 --> 13:57.798
I will definitely defeat him.

14:02.041 --> 14:05.772
Seems like that annoying
miasma's finally disappeared.

14:07.046 --> 14:11.380
The unrest at the imperial
road has been settled.

14:11.584 --> 14:15.111
The robbers on the 6th street
have all been captured.

14:15.421 --> 14:18.015
I see...
good job everyone.

14:18.324 --> 14:22.192
But don't let your guard down.
Continue patrolling the city.

14:22.328 --> 14:23.727
Yes, Sir!

14:25.732 --> 14:28.792
So Yoshimasa's
prayers are taking effect.

14:33.439 --> 14:34.906
Princess!

14:36.276 --> 14:39.177
Princess Nagako...
are you all right?

14:41.614 --> 14:46.210
Mother! Mother! Mother!

14:46.653 --> 14:52.592
Why are you crying so hard?
Did you have a bad dream?

14:52.759 --> 14:56.217
I have caused you
undue worry, Princess...

14:56.329 --> 14:59.924
It's been a long time since
I held you in my arms.

15:00.133 --> 15:02.931
I'm all right now...

15:06.105 --> 15:07.766
I was so lonely.

15:07.974 --> 15:12.741
Is that so?
I was very lonely too.

15:13.613 --> 15:15.979
- Really?
- Yes...

15:17.750 --> 15:20.719
How could I not be lonely?

15:23.489 --> 15:25.423
Mother!

15:26.192 --> 15:29.684
You must have felt
helpless by yourself.

15:33.466 --> 15:38.301
By the way,
where's your lady-in-waiting?

15:38.705 --> 15:41.230
What was her name?

15:46.980 --> 15:50.472
All preparations
are in order.

15:52.485 --> 15:57.354
Kazane...
rest while you still can.

16:16.542 --> 16:19.272
Masahiro... Are you awake?

16:20.213 --> 16:21.578
Akiko...

16:21.714 --> 16:23.409
You got better.

16:23.583 --> 16:25.251
Yes...

16:25.251 --> 16:27.587
But more importantly...

16:27.587 --> 16:29.885
I had... that dream again.

16:33.359 --> 16:35.428
In the darkness...

16:35.428 --> 16:39.091
Mokkun was running far ahead of me.

16:39.866 --> 16:41.857
I even called out to him...

16:42.435 --> 16:46.428
I kept calling him...
as loud as I could.

16:52.178 --> 16:53.577
Masahiro?

16:54.547 --> 16:55.878
Akiko...

16:57.583 --> 17:00.984
Are you okay?
You shouldn't move around.

17:14.067 --> 17:17.901
That wasn't a dream...

17:30.650 --> 17:32.015
Akiko?

17:33.519 --> 17:36.852
It's okay...
you don't have to tell me...

17:36.990 --> 17:40.790
I understand. It's okay.

17:40.927 --> 17:44.988
Akiko, don't cry. I'm okay.

17:51.437 --> 17:53.405
Excuse me.

17:53.573 --> 17:58.340
I'll be okay soon
so don't worry, okay?

18:00.146 --> 18:01.875
I'm sorry...

18:02.281 --> 18:06.377
But... I'm glad
you're all right.

18:06.486 --> 18:08.477
I'm really glad.

18:16.829 --> 18:20.856
I never thought
I'd ever return to Izumo again.

18:21.968 --> 18:23.526
Kouchin, is that you?

18:24.103 --> 18:26.401
How are Tenitsu and Suzaku?

18:26.539 --> 18:28.473
Tenitsu's in bad shape...

18:29.008 --> 18:31.568
If anything goes
wrong, she'll die.

18:32.111 --> 18:35.638
Even shikigami could die.

18:39.185 --> 18:41.415
It's been a while since I came.

18:41.821 --> 18:44.312
You all look depressed.

18:44.824 --> 18:50.228
Touda's fallen into the hands of
the enemy and attacked Masahiro.

18:50.396 --> 18:56.035
I know. Because of that,
Seiryuu is furious and...

18:56.035 --> 18:58.595
determined to kill Touda
this time around.

18:58.871 --> 19:00.270
Kill him?

19:00.940 --> 19:04.068
Is Seiryuu still bent
on killing Guren?

19:05.878 --> 19:07.038
Really...

19:07.180 --> 19:12.140
It's infuriating that someone
wants to mess with us, shikigami.

19:13.419 --> 19:16.820
Beyond that, they even
took Touda away from us.

19:19.358 --> 19:22.452
Since they've stolen him,
we'll just have to get him back.

19:24.397 --> 19:26.456
Calm down, Kouchin.

19:26.599 --> 19:28.191
Well at least...

19:28.234 --> 19:33.399
Masahiro's managed to
escape death.

19:34.740 --> 19:38.198
Where's the man
who took Touda now?

19:39.078 --> 19:43.037
Chishiki no Guuji, Kazane
and Guren are...

19:43.316 --> 19:47.446
at the hill of lfuya
in the eastern part of Izumo.

19:47.820 --> 19:54.460
They're trying to open the Chibiki
rock that leads to the underworld.

19:54.460 --> 19:57.156
I see... Izumo.

20:12.712 --> 20:16.716
Without knowing I was the one
to put you through all this.

20:16.716 --> 20:21.050
your daughter, Kazane,
is fully under my control.

20:22.088 --> 20:26.149
It must be exasperating...
the Miko of the Returning Path.

20:27.126 --> 20:32.498
Very soon, the seal of the
underworld will be broken.

20:32.498 --> 20:35.228
The door will finally be opened.

20:35.368 --> 20:38.735
No one can stop me!

20:38.938 --> 20:41.406
No matter who!

20:42.141 --> 20:45.406
It's great that
Masahiro escaped death...

20:45.478 --> 20:48.470
but what's going on with him?

20:48.514 --> 20:50.277
Even Touda's not around...

20:50.316 --> 20:53.683
he seems so out of it
since he woke up.

20:53.819 --> 20:56.117
Isn't he worried at all?

20:56.622 --> 20:58.817
He just seems calm.

20:59.025 --> 21:00.993
He cannot move
because of his injuries.

21:01.027 --> 21:04.554
When you're sad, don't keep
it inside and just cry!

21:04.697 --> 21:07.564
I hate to see Masahiro like this!

21:07.767 --> 21:09.997
Don't you know?!

21:10.102 --> 21:12.332
You're right, but...

21:17.009 --> 21:20.445
It's not that
he's trying not to cry...

21:21.147 --> 21:23.615
He can't.

21:42.935 --> 21:54.413
Toki to shite hito wa dare mo
Yume wo miushinatte shimau

21:54.413 --> 22:05.725
Ayamachi ya kizutsukikata mo
Jidai wa kurikaesarete iku

22:05.725 --> 22:11.464
Doushite shinjiau koto ni aragauno?

22:11.464 --> 22:17.027
Doushite unmei to iu hikari kesuno?

22:19.338 --> 22:29.615
Bokutachi no mirai wa
Kono te de mamori nukitai

22:29.615 --> 22:36.522
Zenryoku de idomukoto no imi wo

22:36.522 --> 22:41.727
Kimi ga oshietekureta kara

22:41.727 --> 22:47.466
Motto motto kimi wa kimi o koete

22:47.466 --> 22:53.928
Kitto kitto kitto

22:59.745 --> 23:02.646
Next Episode

23:23.302 --> 23:24.769
Next on Shonen Onmyouji...

23:24.837 --> 23:26.236
Episode 23.

23:26.305 --> 23:26.839
Firegod Kagutsuchi's Flames
are Awe-inspiring.

23:26.839 --> 23:29.239
Episode 23
Firegod Kagutsuchi's Flames
are Awe-inspiring
Firegod Kagutsuchi's Flames
are Awe-inspiring.
